#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:1
msgid "排行榜"
msgstr "Leaderboard"

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:3
msgid ""
"本榜单呈现 UniKT 在 14 个公开数据集、15 个评测设置上的 5 折交叉验证结果：先按学生留出 "
"20% 固定测试集，再在剩余 80% 上执行 5 折交叉验证，指标取 5 折均值与标准差。"
msgstr ""
"This leaderboard reports UniKT's five-fold cross-validation results on 14 "
"public datasets under 15 evaluation settings: 20% of students are held out "
"as a fixed test set, the remaining 80% are split into five folds, and "
"scores are the mean and standard deviation over the five folds."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:5
msgid "数据划分、早停策略与指标口径见[评测协议与指标](protocol.md)；各数据集的来源、学生规模与许可证见[数据集](../datasets/index.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Evaluation Protocol and Metrics](protocol.md) for data splitting, "
"early stopping, and metric definitions; see [Datasets](../datasets/index.md) "
"for the source, student count, and license of each dataset."
